          "expression": "neutral",
          "pose": "sit"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "What could she do?",
      "narration": "Her name was Joan. But first, a question. What could a seventeen-year-old girl do against the English army?",
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-3",
