        },
        {
          "name": "Joan",
          "expression": "determined",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "The French commanders didn't take her very seriously. They made their plans without her. So she charged in anyway, banner in hand, and the soldiers followed her.",
      "word_count": 27
    },
    {
