        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "7 May 1429",
      "narration": "On the seventh of May, during the attack on a fortress at the bridge, an arrow struck Joan between her neck and her shoulder. She was carried out of the fight.",
      "word_count": 31
    },
    {
