          "expression": "surprised",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "King",
          "expression": "closed",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "But after the coronation, Charles lost his appetite for fighting. He preferred to negotiate. An attack on Paris failed, and Joan was wounded again.",
      "word_count": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-29",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "Captured",
