          "expression": "smug",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "English knight",
          "expression": "smug",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "King",
          "expression": "closed",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "The Burgundians sold her to the English for a huge sum of money. And King Charles, the man she had led to his crown, did nothing to get her back.",
      "word_count": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-31",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "The trial",
      "start": 403,
      "duration": 16,
      "image": "images/shot-31.png",
      "background": "court",
      "camera": "slow zoom in",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "English knight",
          "expression": "smug",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "Joan",
          "expression": "neutral",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "Rouen, 1431",
      "narration": "The English wanted more than a prisoner. They wanted to prove that her victories had come from the devil, not from God. Because if Joan was a fraud, then Charles had been crowned by a fraud.",
      "word_count": 36
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-32",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "The trial",
      "start": 419,
      "duration": 12,
      "image": "images/shot-32.png",
      "background": "court",
      "camera": "static",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Churchman",
          "expression": "neutral",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cauchon",
          "expression": "angry",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "Churchman",
          "expression": "neutral",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "Bishop Pierre Cauchon",
      "narration": "So in 1431, in the city of Rouen, she was put on trial by a church court led by Bishop Pierre Cauchon, a strong supporter of the English.",
      "word_count": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-33",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "The trial",
      "start": 431,
      "duration": 17,
      "image": "images/shot-33.png",
      "background": "court",
      "camera": "slow zoom in",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Cauchon",
          "expression": "smug",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "Joan",
          "expression": "neutral",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "For months, educated men tried to trap a nineteen-year-old who couldn't read. One asked her if she was in God's grace. It was a trick. If she said yes, she was arrogant. If she said no, she was admitting guilt.",
      "word_count": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-34",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "The trial",
      "start": 448,
      "duration": 11,
      "image": "images/shot-34.png",
      "background": "court",
      "camera": "quick push in",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Joan",
          "expression": "gentle",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "\"If I am not, may God put me there\"",
      "narration": "Joan answered: If I am not, may God put me there. And if I am, may God keep me there. The room went quiet.",
      "word_count": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-35",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "The trial",
      "start": 459,
      "duration": 7,
      "image": "images/shot-35.png",
      "background": "court",
      "camera": "static",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Cauchon",
          "expression": "angry",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "Joan",
          "expression": "closed",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "In the end, she was found guilty anyway. Among the charges: heresy, and wearing men's clothing.",
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-36",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "The darkest day",
      "start": 466,
      "duration": 11,
      "image": "images/shot-36.png",
      "background": "court",
      "camera": "slow zoom in",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Joan",
          "expression": "closed",
          "pose": "bow"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "30 May 1431",
      "narration": "On the thirtieth of May 1431, in the market square of Rouen, Joan was put to death. She was nineteen years old.",
      "word_count": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-37",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "The darkest day",
      "start": 477,
      "duration": 14,
      "image": "images/shot-37.png",
